// synth: library theory (phase 0)
// doc: Python sequence indexing: seq[i] supports negative indices.
// doc: If idx >= 0, it returns the element at zero-based position idx.
// doc: If idx < 0, it returns the element at position |s| + idx (so -1 gives the last element).
