        // The above assertion is provable because:
        // - for j == 0 we proved PyCount(PyRemoveFirst(s1, s[idx]), s[0]) == 0, and indexing matches;
        // - for j >= 1 let j' = j-1; we have 0 <= j' < idx-1 and j' < |PyRemoveFirst(s1,s[idx])|, so
        //   the recursive call gives PyCount(PyRemoveFirst(s1,s[idx])[j'+1..], PyRemoveFirst(s1,s[idx])[j']) == 0,
        //   which corresponds to the required claim for j in the larger sequence.
        // Hence the lemma's ensures holds.
      }
    }
  }
}

